name: Bounded stored architecture reports and honest unknown provenance
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/xray_reader.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/xray_reader.py @TMP_TARGET @ART before
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
submit: setup
require-live-snap: 30 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | setup-unaccepted
expect-not: Map ✓
submit: run x-ray:read
wait: 0.5
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 Recorded report tier: READY | stored-report
expect: Source freshness: not assessed
expect: Original generation spend
expect: unknown
nav-mode:
keys: z
require-live-snap: 20 READ TRANSCRIPT | stored-reader
resize: 160x48
live-snap: report-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: report-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: report-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: report-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: report-40x12
keys: End
live-snap: report-tail-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: report-page-1-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: report-page-2-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: report-page-3-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: report-page-4-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: report-page-5-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: report-page-6-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: report-page-7-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: report-page-8-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: report-page-9-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: report-page-10-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: report-page-11-40x12
ask: Can the recorded tier, parsed counts, unassessed freshness, unknown generation spend and artifact locations be read at every size without implying current source evidence?
keys: q
resize: 120x36
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/xray_reader.py @TMP_TARGET @ART broken
submit: run x-ray:read
wait: 0.5
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 missing or has unsafe required artifact | missing-artifact
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/xray_reader.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restore
submit: run x-ray:read
wait: 0.5
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 Recorded report tier: READY | recovered-report
submit: setup
require-live-snap: 25 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | setup-after-read
expect-not: Map ✓
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/xray_reader.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
ask: Does a missing required artifact fail honestly, with deliberate restoration recovering the reader while Map remains unaccepted?
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 10 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | explicit-quit
keys: y
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
submit: setup
require-live-snap: 30 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | restarted-setup
expect-not: Map ✓
submit: run x-ray:read
wait: 0.5
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 Original generation spend | restarted-report
expect: unknown
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/xray_reader.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
ask: Does no-color restart preserve the same manually supplied report and unknown provenance without model, scanner, decision or Map work?
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 10 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | explicit-restart-quit
keys: y
require-exit: 10
